/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (Each service is responsible for one focused business capability. Maintenance Management only handles maintenance requests and warranty verification; it does not also manage orders or payments. This separation is visible in the Component Diagram, where Account Management, Product Catalog Management, Order Processing, Delivery Management, Maintenance Management, Payment Processing, and Notification Service are each isolated as standalone components with a single responsibility, and in the Detailed Class Diagram, where MaintenanceRequest only contains attributes and operations relevant to a maintenance ticket. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
