178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (Sensitive operations must pass through authentication and authorization, and sensitive data must never be exposed unnecessarily. All external communication uses HTTPS/API, full payment card details are never permanently stored \(only handled through the external Payment Gateway\), and administrative actions on the product catalog are recorded in an audit log. This is addressed in the Architecture Diagram \(Authentication & Authorization Service as a distinct component, HTTPS on all client-server links\) and in the Deployment Diagram, where the Payment Gateway and Security Server are reached over separate, isolated channels \(HTTPS, TCP/IP\) rather than through the database directly. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
